      "name": "Wail of the Betrayed",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "auditory",
        "fear",
        "mental"
      ],
      "text": "Avsheros lets out an agonized wail that invokes grief and a feeling of betrayal in those who hear it.\n\nAll creatures within 120 feet must succeed at a DC 47 Will save save or become Frightened 2. A creature frightened in this way can't willingly accept aid of any kind from an ally until the frightened condition is removed.\n\nOn a successful save, the creature is immune to Avsheros's Wail of the Betrayed for 24 hours."
